  "notes": [
   "Booklet is small and ambiguous in places; piece-to-piece assignments (especially which 1x3/1x4 bricks and plates sit where in steps 5-9) are my best reading of the pictures.",
   "Wheel holders (b17, b18) are added in step 8 with the model flipped upside down; they are clutched onto the underside of the black base plate b1 (rests_on b1).",
   "Wheels and tyres are shown in the booklet's final pictures (step 12); each wheel with its tyre is counted as two pieces. Wheels are placed on the holders' pins, two per holder.",
   "All 33 pieces from the parts list are used: 4 yellow 1x2 plates (b2, b7, b8, b22), 1 clear 1x2 plate (b21), 2 clear and 2 red round 1x1 plates.",
   "Positions left null as requested."
  ]
 },
